                <td><span class="weekly-pill weekly-pill--doc">Disclosure, rolling out</span></td>
                <td>Approvals can be switched off</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>AWS<span class="weekly-table-sub">29 Sep</span></td>
                <td>Agents "support human approval before consequential actions."</td>
                <td><span class="weekly-pill weekly-pill--unk">Preview</span></td>
