          <li>Confirmed exposures or downloads from PixelLeak.</li>
          <li>MetaMCP patch, RSA availability on 16 November, NIST webinar on 28 October.<sup><a href="#s8">8</a></sup></li>
        </ul>

        <div class="weekly-question">When your agent attempts a consequential action without valid authority for that exact execution, does the downstream system reject it?</div>

